    "text_blocks_CAh8Yr": {
      "type": "text-blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_BAV7aA": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "For Players",
            "text": "<p>We've always aspired to support the next generation; not just of golfers, but athletes. Those who excel in their craft and aim to be the best both personally and within their communities. TRUEU is designed to foster relationships with athletes both on and off the course, and seek out those who represent the brand positively in their junior and collegiate careers.<\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_type_2": "primary"
          }
        },
        "text_block_bHf7bc": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "For Coaches",
            "text": "<p>Coaches don't just coach; they inspire, teach, and shape the next generation of athletes - both within their sport and in the classroom. TRUEU is designed to partner with coaches who have a passion for their sport - but also a passion for creating impactful individuals who can positively make an impact for years to come long after their playing career is over.<\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_type_2": "primary"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_block_BAV7aA",
        "text_block_bHf7bc"
      ],
